{
  "name": "Cat Fall",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/ice-aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Dexterity</p><p>You have learned to control your momentum when you fall from a great height, allowing you to mitigate the worst of the damage.</p><ul><li><p>You land without falling <strong>Prone</strong> when you fall from a height of <strong>5 spaces</strong> or lower.</p></li><li><p>You take no damage when you fall from a height of <strong>10 spaces</strong> or lower.</p></li><li><p>When you fall from a height of <strong>11-30 spaces</strong>, you can make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Body (Athletics)</strong> check to reduce the fall <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>-1</strong> per success.</p></li></ul>",
